    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nO'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers are privileged to offer for sale this substantial terraced residence in the heart of Galway City. No.6 New Road is a spacious mid-terrace property offers exceptional accommodation with approximately 151.4 sq.m. Originally constructed circa 1950, the residence will benefit from modernisation but offers excellent potential & charming character throughout. The ground floor is arranged with two large living/reception rooms to the front, a downstairs bathroom, kitchen with garden access, and a sizeable back room offering a variety of options. Upstairs offers five bedrooms & a main bathroom. Externally, no.6 New Road offers off-street parking to the front, a huge benefit for Galway City living, whilst the private rear garden offers excellent depth & plentiful mature greenery. In terms of location, no.6 New road is second-to-none. Situated right in the heart of Galway City, the property is within proximity or walking distance to all of Galway's most iconic attractions such as Spanish Arch, Claddagh Basin, the vibrant Latin Quarter & West and Galway City Centre. Amenities are in abundance, as expected from city living, whilst the area is also ideal for family living being within proximity to a host of quality local schools, Galway University & UCHG, and plentiful outdoor facilities such as South Park, Millennium Park, Fisheries Fields, Dangan Sportsground & the beautiful Galway canals. This home offers a rare opportunity to avail of a city centre residence with substantial space, internally & externally, and excellent potential throughout. Viewing is highly recommended & guaranteed not to disappoint. Keep up to-date with NEW PROPERTIES by registering your details on our database For Further details please contact our office on 091-564212 OFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PMProperties can be viewed on our website www.odj.ie NOTE: These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer. They are for information only and give a general idea of the property. They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact. Whilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars. No person in the employment of O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
